1
00:00:03,628 --> 00:00:04,668
[RAJESH SNEEZES]

2
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:07,218
(Sheldon:)-Hold.
-What?

3
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:08,804
(Sheldon:)Explain your sneeze.

4
00:00:09,926 --> 00:00:11,806
(Raj:)-I'm sorry?
-Do you have allergies?

5
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:13,802
(Raj:)-No.
-Too much pepper on your salad?

6
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:17,434
(Raj:)-I don't put pepper on salads.
-I've heard enough. Sit over there.

7
00:00:17,726 --> 00:00:19,806
Come on, I don't wanna sit by myself.

8
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,900
(Sheldon:)That's what Typhoid Mary said.
Clearly, her friends buckled.

9
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,520
(Raj:)Guys, help me.

10
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:26,523
(Howard:)-Sheldon, come on.
-Yeah, it's just one sneeze.

11
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:27,733
[RAJESH SNEEZES]

12
00:00:27,902 --> 00:00:30,032
(Leonard:)-You're on your own.
-See you, buddy.

13
00:00:31,364 --> 00:00:33,194
(Sheldon:)Oh, Leonard, I have something for you.

14
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:36,496
(Sheldon:)Per our roommate agreement,
this is your 24-hour notice...

15
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:38,951
(Sheldon:)...that I will be having
a non-related female...

16
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:41,662
(Sheldon:)...spending two nights
in our apartment.

17
00:00:43,752 --> 00:00:47,792
(Leonard:)When you say non-related female,
you still mean human, right?

18
00:00:48,006 --> 00:00:49,046
Well, of course.

19
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:52,765
Pets are banned by the agreement,
with the exception of service animals...

20
00:00:52,927 --> 00:00:54,927
(Sheldon:)...such as Seeing Eye dogs
and, one day...

21
00:00:55,096 --> 00:00:57,386
...cybernetically enhanced
helper monkeys.

22
00:00:58,516 --> 00:01:02,026
(Howard:)Are you planning
on kidnapping a woman?

